# Frontend Environment Configuration

# Base URL for the FastAPI backend.
# In local development: defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8000 if omitted.
# In unified Vercel deployment (Layout A): leave empty for same-origin relative API calls.
# In split deployment (Layout B, e.g. Render backend): set to your Render URL.
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
